        "TileImage": "$($repository ed952d7f-456c-4685-a379-e851d44e15c1).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome Agent,\r\rwe have been called because there is an eerie story circulating in the shadows of Mumbai. For weeks, residents have been reporting ghostly apparitions in the city’s streets. \r\rPeople are suddenly changing their appearance, video footage shows shadowy figures, and at night, voices from another world echo from the alleys of the slums.\r\rTake care of them and the ghosts will discover that there are things even they must hide from.\r\rGood Luck\r\r-blauball",
